{
"#synopsis"
:
[
"x agent classify --category <name> <description>... [-] [content]"
]
,
"#tip:note"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"classify 使用 LLM 将内容自动分类到预定义的类别中。\n通过 --category <名称> <描述> 定义候选类别（可多次使用），\n待分类内容可作为参数传入；选项区域的 `-`（或 `--pipe`，须出现在内容参数之前）表示从管道/标准输入读取，\n若同时提供了参数内容，stdin 会作为 <STDIN> 块追加在后面。既没有参数内容也没有 `-` 时，报错退出。\n输出两个部分：第一行为类别名，空行后是多行 markdown 理由。\n若没有类别匹配，类别为 UNKNOWN，理由中按可能性顺序列出候选类别。\n"
,
"en"
:
"classify uses an LLM to classify content into predefined categories.\nDefine candidate categories with --category <name> <description> (repeatable).\nContent to classify is passed as arguments; a leading `-` (or `--pipe`, before content args) reads from stdin/pipe,\nand if arguments are also given, stdin is appended as a <STDIN> block.\nWithout content (and no `-`), it exits with an error.\nOutput has two sections: the category name on the first line, followed by a multiline markdown reason.\nIf nothing fits, the category is UNKNOWN and the reason lists candidates in likelihood order.\n"
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x agent classify --category BUG \"bug report\" --category FEATURE \"feature request\" \"The login button does nothing when clicked\""
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 分类用户反馈"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Classify user feedback"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"echo \"login button broken\" | x agent classify --category BUG \"bug report\" --category FEATURE \"feature request\" -"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 用 `-` 从管道传入内容"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Use `-` to classify piped content"
}
]
,
"-|--pipe"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"从管道/标准输入读取内容，作为 <STDIN> 块追加到参数内容之后（须放在内容参数之前）"
,
"en"
:
"Read content from stdin/pipe, appended as a <STDIN> block after argument content (must precede content args)"
}
}
,
"--category"
:
{
"#multiple"
:
true
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"定义候选类别：--category <名称> <描述>（可多次使用）"
,
"en"
:
"Define a candidate category: --category <name> <description> (repeatable)"
}
}
}

